          "title": "Hope Deferred",
          "subtitle": "Patience",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Hope Deferred is a short non-builder patience also known as Hope, Knockout, Herz zu Herz, or Abandon Hope."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Hope Deferred is an English patience using a 32-card piquet pack. Named variants include Herz zu Herz and Abandon Hope, and the game is notable for a quick three-minute play time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
