              "text": "32-card piquet pack"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "32-card piquet pack, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Lay out Hope Deferred according to its patience tableau, reserve, stock, or foundation structure before beginning play."
